OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity's #15m savings could be
OL,4,Afelt 'beyond the campus', union warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile no figure was given, the
OL,7,FUniversity College Union (UCU)
OL,8,Festimated the cuts could "equate to 100
OL,9,Fto 150 jobs" and could have an impact
OL,10,F"far beyond the campus" in Bangor.
